---
title: "Create a project"
sidebar:
  order: 2
---

Create the project identity and local catalog defaults used by new records.

## Steps

{% steps %}

1. On the home screen, select `+` and then `New project`.
2. Choose `Create new project` and enter the project information and IANA time zone.
3. Choose the main taxon format used for new specimen forms on this device.
4. Choose a personnel or project-based Field ID and complete any requested Cataloger details.
5. Review the summary and select `Create project`.
{% /steps %}

